---
source: crates/daemon/tests/integration/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Reconcile one linked task, or all links. Conflicting edits are preserved for review

Usage: mxr todo microsoft sync [OPTIONS] [TODO_ID]

Arguments:
  [TODO_ID]

Options:
      --dry-run            Read the cached Microsoft task and show changes without applying them
      --account <ACCOUNT>  Limit to one account; the default covers every account
      --format <FORMAT>    [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help               Print help
